   "source": [
    "To create virtual environment:\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda create -p myenv python=3.9 numpy pandas -y```\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda create --name/-n myenv python=3.9 pandas numpy```\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda create -n myenv —-file package-list.txt (import package)```\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda create -n myenv —-clone path/to/file/env1```\n"
   ]
